  </name>
  <questiontext format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>Ortonormálja a \(b_1=\left [ {\begin {array}{cc}0& 2\end {array}} \right ]\), \(b_2=\left [ {\begin {array}{cc}3& -1\end {array}} \right ]\) vektorrendszert! </p>]]></text>
